{
  "_comment": "Review-only final graph literals, not import/transaction syntax. Eight definitions and four owned declarations. Type, BeadType and LinkType are affiliated with BeadType; ConformsTo is affiliated with LinkType. Trusted seed installation and revision allocation remain open. IDs/revisions are placeholders. No implicit affiliation edges. Conformance is acyclic over exact revisions; generic identity-based acyclic is deliberately not enabled on ConformsTo pending the same-identity revision decision.",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "id": "https://example.org/types/beads/type",
      "revision": "type-1",
